# Same-Origin Authentication Pattern

## Problem Solved
Cross-origin authentication between frontend and backend workers causes:
- CORS policy violations
- Cookie delivery issues with SameSite restrictions  
- Complex domain management
- Resource limit issues on free Cloudflare plans

## Solution: Same-Origin Architecture

### Architecture Overview
```
https://app.codevibesmatter.com
├── Frontend Assets: React SPA (static files)
├── API Proxy: /api/* → Backend Worker
└── Authentication: Same-origin cookies ✅

Internal Backend Worker:
├── API routes, auth, database
├── Durable Objects, KV storage  
└── Hidden from public internet
```

## Implementation Pattern

### Frontend Worker Configuration
**File:** [apps/web/wrangler.toml](mdc:apps/web/wrangler.toml)

```toml
# Serve from single domain only
[[env.production.routes]]
pattern = "app.codevibesmatter.com"
custom_domain = true

# Assets configuration
[assets]
directory = "./dist/client"
not_found_handling = "single-page-application"

# Environment variables
[env.production.vars]
API_BASE_URL = "https://vibestack-server-production.team-c5f.workers.dev"
```

### API Proxy Implementation
**File:** [apps/web/worker/index.ts](mdc:apps/web/worker/index.ts)

```typescript
export default {
  async fetch(request, env) {
    const url = new URL(request.url);
    
    // Proxy API requests to backend worker
    if (url.pathname.startsWith('/api/')) {
      const backendUrl = new URL(url.pathname, env.API_BASE_URL);
      return fetch(backendUrl, {
        method: request.method,
        headers: request.headers,
        body: request.body,
      });
    }
    
    // Serve static assets
    return env.ASSETS.fetch(request);
  }
};
```

### Backend Worker Configuration
**File:** [apps/server/wrangler.toml](mdc:apps/server/wrangler.toml)

```toml
# NO custom domains - accessed internally only
name = "vibestack-server-production"

# Internal access via workers.dev URL
# https://vibestack-server-production.team-c5f.workers.dev
```

### Authentication Configuration

#### Backend Auth Setup
**File:** [apps/server/src/lib/auth.ts](mdc:apps/server/src/lib/auth.ts)

```typescript
export const auth = betterAuth({
  // Use frontend domain as base URL
  baseUrl: env.BETTER_AUTH_URL, // "https://app.codevibesmatter.com"
  
  // Same-origin configuration
  trustedOrigins: [env.API_URL], // ["https://app.codevibesmatter.com"]
  
  // Simple cookie configuration
  session: {
    cookieCache: {
      enabled: true,
      maxAge: 5 * 60 // 5 minutes
    }
  },
  
  // Cookie settings for same-origin
  cookies: {
    secure: true,
    sameSite: "lax", // Works with same-origin
    // No domain needed - defaults to current domain
  }
});
```

#### Frontend Auth Configuration
**File:** [apps/web/src/lib/auth.ts](mdc:apps/web/src/lib/auth.ts)

```typescript
export const authClient = createAuthClient({
  // Always use same-origin
  baseURL: window.location.origin, // No cross-origin detection needed
});
```

